/**
 * SectionBody — the kind → component switch, with NO wrapper chrome.
 *
 * Extracted from SectionRenderer.astro (2026-07-05) so two shells can compose
 * it: the article shell (SectionRenderer = core/Section.astro chrome + this)
 * and story mode (`/s/<slug>/` full-bleed cards — see
 * docs/design/STORY-MODE-SPEC.md). Add new kinds HERE (and register them in
 * SECTION_KINDS + docs/design/catalog.md; see src/components/AGENTS.md §3).
 */
